{
  "name": "AsyncapiForge - nano-tools",
  "short_name": "AsyncapiForge",
  "description": "AsyncAPI 校验器：粘贴 YAML 或 JSON 文档，自动识别 3.0 与 2.x 代际，校验 info/servers/channels/operations 必填项、地址风格与重复、send|receive 语义、消息载荷与 $ref 断引用，绘制服务与频道的发布订阅拓扑，并给出 2.x 升级 3.0 的逐项改写提示。评审事件驱动契约、排查消息通道配置，零依赖、离线可用。 · 单文件 · 零依赖 · 本地优先",
  "start_url": "./",
  "scope": "./",
  "display": "standalone",
  "background_color": "#0A0A0B",
  "theme_color": "#5E6AD2",
  "icons": [
    {
      "src": "og.svg",
      "sizes": "any",
      "type": "image/svg+xml",
      "purpose": "any"
    }
  ]
}
